{"name": "Bombun", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/5c136d954322bfdacec45c7ebb06ad25.poster.avif?t=1785197417\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/5c136d954322bfdacec45c7ebb06ad25.webm?t=1785197417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/5c136d954322bfdacec45c7ebb06ad25.mp4?t=1785197417\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Take to the skies in this explosive 3D platformer adventure!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High above the clouds, <strong>Bombun</strong>\u00a0guards her floating fortress from danger. But peace is short-lived. Her former friend, now reengineered and ruthless, returns as <strong>Robombun</strong>, leading an aerial uprising with a mechanized army of drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, dodge, and blast your way through soaring sky islands and high-tech strongholds. Master precision platforming, use explosive abilities, and face off in bombastic battles against Robombun\u2019s robotic forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you outmaneuver the machines and save the skies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/ac445a98433b67e16e58f7524892e0bb.poster.avif?t=1785197417\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/ac445a98433b67e16e58f7524892e0bb.webm?t=1785197417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/ac445a98433b67e16e58f7524892e0bb.mp4?t=1785197417\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>3D platforming action.</i></strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Traverse through 6 floating worlds.</i></strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Stylized visuals and explosive combat mechanics.</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/60716325fbd1e9f620963352a59b54ed.avif?t=1785197417\" width=\"600\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A bomb-throwing rabbit defends her floating fortress from her former friend turned foe.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/00a1c27e613a447234a8dbea9898963d806dc51f/header.jpg?t=1785197417", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Cute", "3D Platformer", "Colorful", "Female Protagonist", "Adventure"], "developers": "Kekitopu", "publishers": "Kekitopu", "release_date": "Mar 27, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "3609320", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "20 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/D8vmxJdnuMA", "first_seen": 1771542000.0, "review_rank": 1148}